{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Alicia's Reaper Scripts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 These are scripts I have personally done to better my workflow or have convinced others to aid me in writting them. The were born out of necessity from tryiong to simply my mixing and mastering workflows, and they cover a vast array of tools from time tracking to performing repetitive tasks that I could automate to save me time.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Installing from my github repository\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Copy the following url and paste inside Extensions > ReaPack > Import a Repository:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 (https://github.com/alicia4prez/ReaScripts_lua/raw/master/index.xml)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Included Scripts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scripts\\ALiXiA_Diatonic major minor mode transposer\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scripts\\ALiXiA_Session setup and ingestion\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scripts\\ALiXiA_Digital Fingerprint\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scripts\\ALiXiA_Studio Manager Script\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scripts\\AliXiA_Real Stage Gaining Monitor For Mixing\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scripts\\ALiXiA_Mix Prep and Session Sanitizer\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel3 \b \fs24 ## Manual Download Instructions (Optional)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 If you would prefer to download the scripts here manually, you can click on "Clone or Download", Download as ZIP, and then place the scripts anywhere you would like on your PC. I would recommend placing them within <AppData\\Roaming\\REAPER\\Scripts>, as they will get included whenever you export or backup your Reaper configuration.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Special Thanks To\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Rhea Gem\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Higgins Clark\sa180\par}
}
